[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18120.15, "timestamp": "05:02:00", "text": "打破不了它？  等待。一個是唱歌練習用的，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18123.07, "timestamp": "05:02:03", "text": "可可蝦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18126.23, "timestamp": "05:02:06", "text": "記住這一點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18131.59, "timestamp": "05:02:11", "text": "我們只打算練習一兩首歌。呃，二是呃，雙語流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18134.47, "timestamp": "05:02:14", "text": "。  我們可能學的其實是中文，而不是日文。我們總有一天會做日文的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18137.19, "timestamp": "05:02:17", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18143.55, "timestamp": "05:02:23", "text": "我們總有一天會學日文的。但就目前而言，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18153.51, "timestamp": "05:02:33", "text": "我希望中國方面優先考慮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18160.09, "timestamp": "05:02:40", "text": "。那嗯，那就是兩個了，對吧？三（音樂）還有什麼其他計劃？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18162.59, "timestamp": "05:02:42", "text": "[音樂] 好的。我還有什麼其他計劃？我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18165.83, "timestamp": "05:02:45", "text": "我剛才"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18169.55, "timestamp": "05:02:49", "text": "說什麼來著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18176.27, "timestamp": "05:02:56", "text": "？天哪，我忘了。我怎麼可能"}]